      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEZA BULLETS (1) is a Suzette Turner-trained newcomer by Bernardo out of Plagiarise. Drawn well and should get his chance. Betting to provide the best guide to his chances. BIG TOWN JADE (7) made contact with another runner and could manage only a distant fifth (19.62) in a Maiden over 320m at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Should be in this for a long way. SPRING SASSY (8) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Hard Right (18.54) in a Maiden. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Leading chance. REBORN DIVA (2) can fill a top-three spot.",
